Thought: First, I need to generate a dataset of sulphide polymorphs. I'll use batch_retrieve_polymorphs to get data for multiple sulphide compositions.
Action: batch_retrieve_polymorphs
Action Input: {"compositions": ["FeS", "FeS2", "CoS", "CoS2", "NiS", "NiS2", "CuS", "Cu2S", "ZnS", "MnS", "MoS2", "WS2", "VS2", "TiS2", "SnS", "SnS2", "PbS", "Ag2S", "CdS", "In2S3"], "max_energy_above_hull": 0.3, "max_per_composition": 3, "save_directory": "polymorph_data"}

Thought: Now that I have retrieved the polymorph data for all compositions, I need to consolidate them into a single dataset. I'll use the consolidate_polymorph_datasets tool with the composition_files mapping from the previous result.
Action: consolidate_polymorph_datasets
Action Input: {"composition_files": {"FeS": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/FeS_polymorphs.json", "FeS2": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/FeS2_polymorphs.json", "CoS": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/CoS_polymorphs.json", "CoS2": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/CoS2_polymorphs.json", "NiS": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/NiS_polymorphs.json", "NiS2": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/NiS2_polymorphs.json", "CuS": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/CuS_polymorphs.json", "Cu2S": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/Cu2S_polymorphs.json", "ZnS": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/ZnS_polymorphs.json", "MnS": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/MnS_polymorphs.json", "MoS2": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/MoS2_polymorphs.json", "WS2": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/WS2_polymorphs.json", "VS2": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/VS2_polymorphs.json", "TiS2": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/TiS2_polymorphs.json", "SnS": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/SnS_polymorphs.json", "SnS2": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/SnS2_polymorphs.json", "PbS": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/PbS_polymorphs.json", "Ag2S": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/Ag2S_polymorphs.json", "CdS": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/CdS_polymorphs.json", "In2S3": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/polymorph_data/In2S3_polymorphs.json"}, "output_path": "consolidated_sulphides.json"}

Thought: Now that I have consolidated the data, I need to prepare a tabular dataset for machine learning with advanced feature engineering. I'll use the prepare_tabular_dataset tool with the specified parameters.
Action: prepare_tabular_dataset
Action Input: {"polymorphs_json_path": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/consolidated_sulphides.json", "output_path": "sulphides_ml_dataset", "target_property": "formation_energy_per_atom", "feature_engineering": "advanced", "test_split": 0.2, "normalize": true}

Thought: Now I'll train an XGBoost model using the prepared dataset with the specified hyperparameters.
Action: train_xgboost_model
Action Input: {"train_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/sulphides_ml_dataset/train.csv", "test_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/sulphides_ml_dataset/test.csv", "model_save_path": "sulphides_xgboost_model.pkl", "target_column": "formation_energy_per_atom", "hyperparameters": {"n_estimators": 200, "max_depth": 8, "learning_rate": 0.1, "subsample": 0.8, "colsample_bytree": 0.8, "reg_alpha": 0.1, "reg_lambda": 0.1}}

Thought: Now I'll perform cross-validation to get a more robust estimate of model performance.
Action: perform_cross_validation
Action Input: {"train_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_sulphides_trial_4/sulphides_ml_dataset/train.csv", "target_column": "formation_energy_per_atom", "cv_folds": 5, "hyperparameters": {"n_estimators": 200, "max_depth": 8, "learning_rate": 0.1, "subsample": 0.8, "colsample_bytree": 0.8, "reg_alpha": 0.1, "reg_lambda": 0.1}}

Thought: Now I have all the necessary results to create the final JSON output with test set evaluation and cross-validation results.
Action: write_file
Action Input: {"path": "model_evaluation_results.json", "content": {"test_set_evaluation": {"mae": 0.11623246463100612, "rmse": 0.14236784847128348, "r2": 0.7914257529687818, "feature_importance": {"density": 0.09918582439422607, "volume": 0.010179473087191582, "nsites": 0.004000906366854906, "band_gap": 0.041779372841119766, "energy_above_hull": 0.006658576428890228, "lattice_a": 0.0051688845269382, "lattice_b": 0.02015993744134903, "lattice_c": 0.002679734490811825, "lattice_alpha": 0.023277312517166138, "lattice_beta": 0.0034148930571973324, "lattice_gamma": 0.08456967771053314, "lattice_volume": 0.017358975484967232, "num_species": 0.0, "packing_efficiency": 0.04911738261580467, "space_group_number": 0.08150126039981842, "crystal_system": 0.012917551212012768, "num_elements": 0.0, "electronegativity_diff": 0.5380303263664246}}, "cross_validation_results": {"r2_mean": 0.6934240289531324, "r2_std": 0.1514728238920674}}}
